\par\par \b \uc2 INSTANT VIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank holds rate, aids  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2011\par 22:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Jan 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held its benchmark interest rate <CLINTR=ECI> steady at 3.25 percent on Thursday, pausing after seven straight increases as it juggles \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to tame the peso and inflation concerns.\par \par \uc2 The market had been split over whether the bank would raise or hold rates. For a preview, see [ID:nN13283103]\par \par \uc2 COMMENTARY:\par \par \uc2 MATIAS MADRID, CHIEF ECONOMIST BANCO PENTA\par \par \uc2 "For us, this is a surprise and it's explained by efforts to further help \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I think it will be a very short-lived pause, but that will mostly depend on the exchange rate."\par \par \uc2 MARIO AREND, CHIEF ECONOMIST CELFIN CAPITAL\par \par \uc2 "I think this was the right decision because it helps the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  process. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is sending a signal that it sees limited inflationary pressures as a result of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 VALENTIN DELANO, CHIEF ECONOMIST CRUZ DEL SUR BROKERAGE\par \par \uc2 "This could increase the demand for short-term debt in UF inflation-indexed units. On the exchange rate front we believe that this will likely halt the fall of the dollar locally, but as long as we have the fundamentals, one should expect more inflows of dollars."\par \par \uc2 "We will likely see several months of high inflation and that can put the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a tight spot."\par \par \uc2 HERMANN GONZALEZ, ECONOMIST ZAHLER AND CO CONSULTANCY\par \par \uc2 "The recent appreciation of the peso only ratified the need for a pause in rates, so the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be more effective. If my scenario proves right, we should see the peso depreciate and lower (debt) interest rates in the short term." (Reporting by Maria Jose Latorre; Editing by Andrew Hay)\par \par \uc2 CHILE-RATES/ (INSTANT VIEW)|LANGEN|ABN|D|E|RBN|M|U   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110116e71d000i1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
