\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  cenbank holds rates to complement  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 643 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2011\par 12:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  * \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says core inflation readings remain limited\par \par \uc2  * Cenbank acknowledges long-term inflation expectations up\par \par \uc2  * Rates seen rising in coming months with pauses  (Updates with economist comments, peso implications)\par \par \uc2  By Moises Avila and Brad Haynes\par \par \uc2  SANTIAGO, Jan 13 (Reuters) - Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held its benchmark interest rate <CLINTR=ECI> steady at 3.25 percent on Thursday, pausing after seven straight increases to complement a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the cost of inflation concerns.\par \par \uc2  Market watchers polled by Reuters had been split over whether the bank would raise or hold rates, and the decision may halt the peso's 3-day rebound after a post-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  slide. [ID:nnN11108678]\par \par \uc2  Some analysts had expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to complement its $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sap peso strength with a temporary pause in the monetary tightening cycle after weighing such a pause at last month's meeting. [ID:nN03172599]\par \par \uc2  But consumer prices and economic growth have risen faster than expected in recent months, prompting others to bet on an eighth consecutive rate hike. [ID:nN07180158]\par \par \uc2  "I think this was the right decision because it helps the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  process," said Mario Arend, chief economist with Celfin Capital.\par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is sending a signal that it sees limited inflationary pressures resulting from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which could help lower inflation expectations." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\par > For a TAKE-A-LOOK, see                   [ID:nN30113748]\par > For a graphic, see           \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://r.reuters.com/ren36r"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://r.reuters.com/ren36r}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 > TEXT-Chile cenbank keeps key rate steady [ID:nN13105441]\par > INSTANT VIEW-Rate hold aids \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  [ID:nN13151376]\par  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^>\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  Consumer prices in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Chile\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rose 3 percent last year, in line\par with the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's inflation target.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  Regional powerhouse Brazil, in contrast, ended 2010 with\par inflation at a six-year high, fueling speculation the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  there will raise interest rates next week for the first\par time since July. [ID:nN07222092]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  Much of Latin America is grappling with rising food prices,\par which have been largely countered in Chile by the strong peso\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . [ID:nN06281566]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  "Domestic activity, demand and jobs data continue to evolve\par positively," the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said in a statement,\par acknowledging that private inflation expectations had risen,\par especially in the short term. "Core inflation readings remain\par limited."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  Two \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  polls this week showed traders and\par analysts, while divided, were opting for a median 25 basis\par point increase.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  "The decision to keep the policy rate on hold could be seen\par as monetary policy being sacrificed for \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy, since the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has signaled that it is worried about the pace of\par peso appreciation," Nomura Securities wrote in a note to\par clients.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  Seven successive rate hikes have lured foreign investment\par into local financial markets, one factor that helped propel the\par peso up 17 percent in the second half of 2010 to its strongest\par in nearly three years.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  That prompted the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to introduce the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  last week, following Brazil, Peru and Colombia in\par moving to rein in its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as investments pour into the\par fast-growing emerging markets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  The peso depreciated around 6 percent against the dollar in\par the first week of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , before rebounding more than\par 2 percent from four-month lows this week. [ID:nN12205368]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 BNP Paribas\f28 \uc2 \f2  warned in a midday Thursday note to clients\par that the peso's recovery could be fleeting if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par held rates stable after markets closed.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2  "As the market is fully pricing in a 25 basis point hike\par late today, our call of rates being kept unchanged at 3.25\par percent should produce a more significant negative impact on\par the peso," wrote \f28 \uc2 \f2 BNP Paribas\f28 \uc2 \f2  analyst Diego Donadio.\par  (With reporting by Alonso Soto, Antonio de la Jara and Fabian\par Cambero in Santiago and Daniel Bases in New York; Editing by\par Simon Gardner and Kenneth Barry)\par \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 CHILE-ECONOMY/RATES (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110113e71d000wg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
