\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  peso extends post- \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  rebound\b0\par\par\uc2 423 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 2011\par 16:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * Peso seen stabilizing below 490 per dollar\par \par \uc2 * A fresh \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate hike would boost rally (Updates with peso close, adds byline)\par \par \uc2 By Froilan Romero\par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO, Jan 12 (Reuters) - Chile's peso <CLP=CL> rose more than 1 percent on Wednesday, extending a post-\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rebound from four-month lows hit this week, driven by strong prices for main export copper.\par \par \uc2 The peso on Tuesday broke a five-day slide that followed a $12 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  plan introduced last week as the peso neared three-year highs. The peso firmed 1.2 percent on Wednesday to close at 490.40/490.90 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Chile, the world's No. 1 copper producer, has followed Brazil, Peru and Colombia in moving to rein in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as investments pour into the fast-growing emerging markets.\par \par \uc2 "With all the markets positive and the dollar weak abroad, demand for dollars dried up and now it's expected to stabilize under 490 pesos per dollar," said one \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader.\par \par \uc2 The peso has depreciated around 5 percent against the dollar since the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  began.\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  poll released on Wednesday showed a majority of traders expect the bank to raise its benchmark interest rate <CLINTR=ECI> by 25 basis points to 3.5 percent at Thursday's rate-setting meeting. For details, see [ID:nSAG002686]\par \par \uc2 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ > For a TAKE-A-LOOK, see [ID:nN30113748]\par \par \uc2 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^>\par \par \uc2 Economic activity and consumer prices have risen faster than expected in recent months, bolstering forecasts of an eighth-straight rate hike to keep the bank ahead of inflation. [ID:nN07180158]\par \par \uc2 Another 25 basis-point rate hike would likely cause the peso to appreciate further, or at least counter the downward pressure from the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as the wider differential with U.S. interest rates attracts capital inflows. For more, see [ID:nN11108678]\par \par \uc2 Some analysts see the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  complementing its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with a temporary pause in the monetary tightening cycle after the bank board weighed holding its benchmark rate steady at its meeting in December. [ID:nN03172599]\par \par \uc2 A Reuters poll conducted on Friday confirmed that market opinion is closely divided, with poll respondents and interest rate futures evenly split between a fresh rate increase and a pause. [ID:nN11108678]\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  President Jose De Gregorio said on Monday the bank had room to move interest rates as needed amid the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . [ID:nN10272851] (Editing by Simon Gardner and Leslie Adler)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-CHILE/PESO (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|Table|ABN|E|RBN|D|M|RNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110112e71c0014x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
