\par\par \b \uc2 =DJ Emerging-Market  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Seen Facing More Appreciation Pressure\b0\par\par\uc2 By Anjali Cordeiro Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 538 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Januar 2011\par 03:44\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--The upward pressure on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of emerging-market countries is expected to linger this year, causing headaches for policymakers in those countries, even though recent data point to an improving economic outlook for the U.S. and the prospect of a more dollar-supportive policy mix in Washington.\par \par \uc2 Despite strong economic news--such as the gains shown in a U.S. payrolls report Wednesday--analysts still expect the Federal Reserve to stick with its plans to buy $600 billion in government bonds. Liquidity from the Fed's easing is still seen flowing through to emerging markets and seen putting pressure on those \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to appreciate.\par \par \uc2 And, in any case, the strengthening U.S. economy is seen as helping emerging-market economies as well, and ultimately boosting their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Brown Brothers Harriman\uc2 's global head of emerging markets strategy, Win Thin, said he still expects emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to outperform in 2011. Strong U.S. growth ultimately encourages investors to take more risk, and so could drive more flows to emerging-market assets, he noted.\par \par \uc2 "A strong U.S. is great for emerging markets. EM still needs the developed world. That's where they are shipping a lot of their goods," he said.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, a national employment report published by payroll giant \uc2 Automatic Data Processing Inc\uc2 . (ADP) and consultancy \uc2 Macroeconomic Advisers\uc2  showed that private-sector jobs in the U.S. rose by 297,000 last month. Meanwhile, a report from the Institute for Supply Management showed improvement in the U.S. service sector.\par \par \uc2 Most analysts don't expect these data to shift the Fed's plans on quantitative easing--not unless they are backed up by a series of very strong jobs reports in the more closely watched Bureau of Labor Statistics' nonfarm payrolls series.\par \par \uc2 "There are no clear indications that the Fed at this juncture is likely to change its course," said Guillermo Mondino, Latin America research strategist at \uc2 Barclays Capital\uc2 . "If that is the case, then we have a favorable cocktail for emerging markets, liquidity remains abundant and emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are likely to be under [appreciation] pressure."\par \par \uc2 Continued strength in emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to push their policymakers to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets or to introduce capital controls, both to try to hold back potentially volatile "hot money" inflows and to prevent \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation from undermining local producers' competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this week, \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, increasing its foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves by $12 billion in 2011. That \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after the peso traded at a 32-month high and local exporters protested that the peso's strength was hurting their competitiveness.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, Brazil Finance Minister Guido Mantega said his government is ready to take measures against the strengthening local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, and its negative effects on the country's exports. Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , or policy, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains a high risk, RBC analysts wrote in a note this week.\par \par \uc2 -By Anjali Cordeiro, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-2200; anjali.cordeiro@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0-\par \par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011 \uc2 Dow Jones & Company, Inc\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020110107e716002ju\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
