\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Chile \highlight\uc2  Peso Opens 4.2% Weaker On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Intention Announcement\b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 2011\par 12:37\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SANTIAGO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 's peso opened 4.2% weaker against the dollar Tuesday, as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said after the market closed Monday that it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The peso weakened to CLP485.00 to the dollar, versus Monday's close of CLP465.40, which was a 32-month high.\par \par \uc2 Due to the peso's sharp appreciation over the last several months, exporters had clamored for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the strength of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  cuts into the competitiveness of their products abroad.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced on Monday that it will increase its foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves by $12 billion in 2011.\par \par \uc2 The first phase of the bank's program will begin Jan. 5 and end Feb. 9 and will consist of daily purchases of $50 million.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso had reached its 32-month high on the back of historically high copper prices and the growth differential between the Andean nation's quickly recovering economy and sluggish growth in the U.S. As Chile is the world's premier copper producer, accounting for nearly 35% of global supply, the peso often takes cues from the metal's international prices.\par \par \uc2 Due to persistently high copper prices, and expectations for continued strong economic growth in \b \highlight22\uc2 Chile\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts say the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have only a limited effect.\par \par \uc2 "The floor for the Chilean peso should be around CLP480 in the next couple of months. After this, the appreciation forces should continue to push the dollar down," said local investment bank Celfin Capital in a note to clients.\par \par \uc2 (Peso bond quote provided by Valor Futuro newswire.)\par \par \uc2 -By Anthony Esposito, Dow Jones Newswires; 56-2-715-8929; anthony.esposito@dowjones.com [ 04-01-11 1158GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1170 1844   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110104e714000o6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
